    gifts1:"What we value most is sharing this day with you.",
    gifts2:"If you wish to give us a gift, a cash contribution will be received with all our heart. There will be a mailbox at the reception.",
    gifts3:"For practical reasons, we can’t easily receive boxes or packages.",
